d listen to music in my headphones and look at little shops. I love little markets or shops. It's my favorite activity to do. I also love traveling and I love learning. What do you like to do? My favorite food is Japanese food. I love fish. And Japanese food has fish in almost every dish. Take your time answering each question and shadowing each answer with me. Ask me any questions in the comments. I promise I will answer them all. I will be going live November 23rd. We can practice English together live on YouTube, Tik Tok or Instagram. I will be speaking slowly and answering any questions you might have about the story. So, join me November 23rd at 2:00 p.m. or 14 hours UTC. See you there. Make sure to like this video so more people can practice English. Don't forget to subscribe. Bye. >> [music]",
